WEBVTT

00:00.072 --> 00:00.441
Alam mo ba

00:00.441 --> 00:01.000
kung sino ang

00:01.000 --> 00:01.679
kauna-unahang

00:01.679 --> 00:02.703
babaeng sundalo sa

00:02.703 --> 00:03.334
Pilipinas na

00:03.334 --> 00:04.274
ginawaran ng Medal

00:04.274 --> 00:04.924
of Valor?

00:05.124 --> 00:05.898
Ang pinakamataas

00:05.898 --> 00:06.457
na parangal ng

00:06.457 --> 00:07.060
militar,

00:07.088 --> 00:07.422
para sa

00:07.422 --> 00:08.179
katapangan.

00:08.379 --> 00:08.999
Nang bumabagsak

00:08.999 --> 00:09.910
ang eroplano niya,

00:09.915 --> 00:10.629
may pagkakataon

00:10.629 --> 00:11.463
siyang mag-eject

00:11.463 --> 00:12.280
at mabuhay.

00:12.480 --> 00:12.969
Pero hindi niya

00:12.969 --> 00:13.773
ito ginawa.

00:13.973 --> 00:14.520
Siya si Mary

00:14.520 --> 00:15.373
Grace Baloyo.

00:15.573 --> 00:16.025
Pero sa mga

00:16.025 --> 00:16.752
kasamahan niya,

00:16.752 --> 00:17.525
siya si Amazing

00:17.525 --> 00:18.080
Grace.

00:18.280 --> 00:18.863
Lumaki siya sa

00:18.863 --> 00:19.435
Bacolod,

00:19.435 --> 00:20.244
panganay sa apat

00:20.244 --> 00:21.204
na magkakapatid.

00:21.404 --> 00:21.927
Nang sabihin

00:21.927 --> 00:22.344
niyang gusto

00:22.344 --> 00:22.808
niyang maging

00:22.808 --> 00:23.363
piloto,

00:23.511 --> 00:24.118
ayaw pa noong

00:24.118 --> 00:24.773
una ng nanay

00:24.773 --> 00:25.196
niya.

00:25.396 --> 00:26.146
Pero kalaunan,

00:26.146 --> 00:27.034
pumayag din siya.

00:27.234 --> 00:28.908
At noong 1997,

00:28.937 --> 00:29.651
nagtapos siya sa

00:29.651 --> 00:30.199
Philippine Air

00:30.199 --> 00:30.901
Force Flying

00:30.901 --> 00:31.468
School.

00:31.668 --> 00:32.001
At alam mo

00:32.001 --> 00:32.473
rin ba?

00:32.673 --> 00:33.233
Hindi lang siya

00:33.233 --> 00:34.121
basta piloto.

00:34.321 --> 00:34.761
Isa siya sa

00:34.761 --> 00:35.607
anim na babaeng

00:35.607 --> 00:36.452
combat pilot ng

00:36.452 --> 00:37.233
Air Force.

00:37.433 --> 00:38.052
Ang pinalilipad

00:38.052 --> 00:38.429
niya:

00:38.445 --> 00:39.762
ang OV-10 Bronco,

00:39.791 --> 00:40.410
isang attack

00:40.410 --> 00:40.881
plane.

00:41.081 --> 00:41.700
Lumipad siya sa

00:41.700 --> 00:42.248
kampanya sa

00:42.248 --> 00:42.898
Mindanao,

00:42.902 --> 00:43.993
sa Camp Abubakar,

00:44.057 --> 00:44.843
at ilang medalya

00:44.843 --> 00:45.498
na ang natanggap

00:45.498 --> 00:45.862
niya.

00:46.062 --> 00:46.943
Bente-siyete anyos

00:46.943 --> 00:47.312
pa lang siya

00:47.312 --> 00:47.807
noon,

00:47.871 --> 00:48.586
at nakatakda na

00:48.586 --> 00:49.478
sanang ikasal sa

00:49.478 --> 00:50.478
susunod na taon,

00:50.478 --> 00:51.109
sa kapwa niya

00:51.109 --> 00:51.676
piloto.

00:51.876 --> 00:52.578
Pero noong March

00:52.578 --> 00:53.412
26,

00:53.412 --> 00:54.395
2001,

00:54.423 --> 00:55.292
lumipad siya mula

00:55.292 --> 00:56.138
Cavite papuntang

00:56.138 --> 00:56.549
Clark,

00:56.661 --> 00:57.185
kasama ang

00:57.185 --> 00:57.995
co-pilot niyang si

00:57.995 --> 00:58.602
Captain Ben

00:58.602 --> 00:59.228
Nasayao.

00:59.428 --> 01:00.000
Palapit na sila

01:00.000 --> 01:00.566
sa Clark,

01:00.571 --> 01:00.976
nang biglang

01:00.976 --> 01:02.066
masira ang makina.

01:02.266 --> 01:02.707
Mabilis na

01:02.707 --> 01:03.350
bumabagsak ang

01:03.350 --> 01:04.035
eroplano,

01:04.052 --> 01:04.754
papunta sa isang

01:04.754 --> 01:05.719
matataong lugar sa

01:05.719 --> 01:06.409
Mabalacat,

01:06.409 --> 01:07.023
Pampanga.

01:07.222 --> 01:08.091
Ilang segundo bago

01:08.091 --> 01:08.698
bumagsak,

01:08.698 --> 01:09.329
nag-eject si

01:09.329 --> 01:10.312
Captain Nasayao.

01:10.512 --> 01:11.305
Nakaligtas siya.

01:11.505 --> 01:12.333
Pero si Grace?

01:12.533 --> 01:12.890
Hindi siya

01:12.890 --> 01:13.552
nag-eject.

01:13.753 --> 01:14.419
Nanatili siya sa

01:14.419 --> 01:14.836
loob,

01:14.836 --> 01:15.538
at pinilit niyang

01:15.538 --> 01:16.538
ilayo ang eroplano

01:16.538 --> 01:17.438
sa mga bahay.

01:17.638 --> 01:18.329
Bumagsak ito sa

01:18.329 --> 01:19.007
isang bakanteng

01:19.007 --> 01:19.395
lote,

01:19.412 --> 01:19.972
sa gitna ng

01:19.972 --> 01:21.038
isang subdivision.

01:21.238 --> 01:21.928
Namatay agad si

01:21.928 --> 01:22.471
Grace.

01:22.671 --> 01:23.219
Ayon sa tatay

01:23.219 --> 01:23.623
niya,

01:23.623 --> 01:24.028
mahigit

01:24.028 --> 01:24.564
dalawandaang

01:24.564 --> 01:25.135
pamilya ang

01:25.135 --> 01:25.921
nailigtas ng

01:25.921 --> 01:26.749
desisyong iyon.

01:26.949 --> 01:27.449
Sabi nga ng

01:27.449 --> 01:28.176
isang residente

01:28.176 --> 01:28.659
doon:

01:28.664 --> 01:29.385
namatay siya,

01:29.402 --> 01:30.349
para mabuhay kami.

01:30.549 --> 01:31.311
Ginawaran siya ni

01:31.311 --> 01:32.049
Pangulong Gloria

01:32.049 --> 01:32.834
Macapagal-Arroyo

01:32.834 --> 01:33.454
ng Medal of

01:33.454 --> 01:33.961
Valor,

01:34.073 --> 01:34.930
at itinaas ang

01:34.930 --> 01:35.680
ranggo niya bilang

01:35.680 --> 01:36.342
Captain.

01:36.542 --> 01:37.180
At heto pa!

01:37.380 --> 01:37.642
Siya ang

01:37.642 --> 01:38.309
kauna-unahang

01:38.309 --> 01:39.118
babae sa buong

01:39.118 --> 01:40.011
Armed Forces of

01:40.011 --> 01:40.797
the Philippines na

01:40.797 --> 01:41.709
nakatanggap nito.

01:41.909 --> 01:42.361
Ayon nga sa

01:42.361 --> 01:43.111
isang pahayagan

01:43.111 --> 01:43.571
noon:

01:43.623 --> 01:44.468
ipinakita niya sa

01:44.468 --> 01:45.278
ating lahat kung

01:45.278 --> 01:46.171
paano mamatay ang

01:46.171 --> 01:46.849
isang tunay na

01:46.849 --> 01:47.499
sundalo.

01:47.698 --> 01:48.098
Ngayon,

01:48.115 --> 01:48.769
may rebulto siya

01:48.769 --> 01:49.519
sa Bacolod,

01:49.519 --> 01:49.948
para hindi

01:49.948 --> 01:50.710
makalimutan ang

01:50.710 --> 01:51.646
kabayanihan niya.

01:51.847 --> 01:52.604
I-share mo ito,

01:52.633 --> 01:53.395
para mas maraming

01:53.395 --> 01:53.943
Pilipino ang

01:53.943 --> 01:54.800
makakilala kay

01:54.800 --> 01:55.771
Amazing Grace.

01:55.971 --> 01:56.423
At kung gusto

01:56.423 --> 01:56.744
mo pa ng

01:56.744 --> 01:57.304
mga ganitong

01:57.304 --> 01:57.823
kwento,

01:57.923 --> 01:58.835
i-follow mo ako,

01:58.887 --> 01:59.614
dito sa Juan

01:59.614 --> 02:00.406
Fact a Day!
